      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/9/f998fac00cebf453d9c70791331106c68a3f255d.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/f998fac00cebf453d9c70791331106c68a3f255d\" title=\"WhatsApp Image 2025-10-05 at 10.33.57 AM\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/9/f998fac00cebf453d9c70791331106c68a3f255d_2_281x500.jpeg\" alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2025-10-05 at 10.33.57 AM\" data-base62-sha1=\"zC2E7Oqb85FSKKx4ukMGMW0hD6l\" width=\"281\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/9/f998fac00cebf453d9c70791331106c68a3f255d_2_281x500.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/9/f998fac00cebf453d9c70791331106c68a3f255d_2_421x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/9/f998fac00cebf453d9c70791331106c68a3f255d_2_562x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"AEB2AD\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">WhatsApp Image 2025-10-05 at 10.33.57 AM</span><span class=\"informations\">720×1280 79.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Hi all, i just migrated my entire server from a third party to frappe cloud. To enable customisation by doctype, i want to enable developer_mode and server script enabled. i am sure i have done this before simply by giving key and value in the bench settings of frappe cloud. But now i cannot see that option . i don’t understand why the bench settings say the custom key is blacklisted or deprecated. is this a new frappe bench updation?  Please guide me to understand the situation to a functional solution.</p>",
