      "created_at": "2025-10-05T11:12:16.346Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, I can’t really imagine how <code>developer_mode</code> would work on a hosted instance, at least not without shell access. I agree with <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/bahaou\">@bahaou</a>’s advice. If what you need to do can’t be done with site customization, your best option would likely be to do your development locally and then sync it to a custom bench.</p>",
